Z||000012||Standard||09-05-2000||04:28 AM||||No such thing as an 86 notchback GT..<P>My view on the 86/86.5 GT thing... 86 GT = auto or 4 spd, 86.5 = 5 spd...  'cause ya see.. it <B>was</B> a running change, introduced towards the end of the 86 GT production run... and it helps differentiate the rare models  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR>Mike -<BR>Black 86.5 GT 5 Spd, 150,000 miles and counting!       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/BURNOUT.gif">    <BR>Red 84 Sport Coupe - winter donut maker||||reg||1
